Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! I hope it does you good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Because remember one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There is help, even for you who've had so much to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when you feel stuck, you can always choose one side of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as one side always wants to drag you down,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,there's also one that helps you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go behind the curtain down in the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There are four objects there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch them. They give protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.46,0:00:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Go in peace.
